# ACE sidecar for wiki/models/gpt-5-5.md  (subject: aiw:gpt-5-5)
# Controlled-English restatement of the page's assertable facts.
# Proper names (Gpt-5-5, Gpt-5-5-Pro, Gpt-5-5-Thinking, Gpt-5-5-Instant, Gpt-5-4,
# Gpt-5-3-Instant, Claude-Opus-4-7, Openai, Anthropic, Codex, Chatgpt, benchmark and
# benchmark-result individuals, Domain-*/Tag-*/Subcategory-* concepts) compile to
# aiw:<slug> — no lexicon entry needed.

# --- Type and provider (frontmatter type: model; intro: OpenAI's frontier model) ---
Gpt-5-5 is a model.
Openai is a company.
Anthropic is a company.
Gpt-5-5 is-provided-by Openai.

